cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it."
title: "Replication package: a pre-authentication key parse dominates JWT validation in jsonwebtoken"
abstract: >-
  Measurements, instrumentation, harnesses and analysis code for a study of
  where the per-request cost of JSON Web Token validation goes in the Node.js
  library jsonwebtoken: a discarded asymmetric key-parse attempt, its
  dependence on the bundled OpenSSL release, a cross-library comparison in
  four languages, a prevalence survey of public call sites, and a narrow fix
  that preserves the library's key-confusion defence.
type: dataset
